==Battleground==
*1 [[Kite Cat (Enemy)|Kite Cat]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dober P.D]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Kite Cat (Enemy)|Kite Cats]] spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring solid tanks. DON'T bring units with over 400 range or it will get demolished, unless your units are over 550 range like [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]], [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]], etc.

